WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6ae152bbbf9d11c475011619 — Episode 63 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-26 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.180
What are you doing here?

2
00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:06.180
Just come home Cal. It was all a misunderstanding. We know we messed up.

3
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:12.180
The company has some cash flow issues. But as long as you're willing to help out with your savings, we can still fix it.

4
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.180
So you're not here to apologize. You're here for money.

5
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:19.180
No, we're here because we were worried about you.

6
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:24.180
Cal, I really have changed my mind. I am completely done with Chase.

7
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:29.180
I see you finally learned who Chase really is. Otherwise you wouldn't be standing here.

8
00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.180
No! I just realized that the one I've always loved was you.

9
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.180
Cal, you have to at least do it for Willa. She can't live without her father.

10
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:45.530
I'll always love you. But grown-up problems are not for you to carry.

11
00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:48.530
If you just come back, I will change everything!

12
00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:53.530
We are done. Stop coming after me and stop using our daughter as leverage.

13
00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.530
Cal, don't push it! We are begging you!

14
00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.530
Ellora is your wife! You have to go back with her!

15
00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:04.890
Have security escort them off the premises.

16
00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.890
Mr. Sterling, what are your orders?

17
00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.890
Mr. Sterling? What did you just call him?
